; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.32 on BTCUSD - rank 2: M5 both, session 1200-1630 server time, trend filter H4. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Backtest Jan 2025-May 2026 (Binance BTCUSDT M1, assumed spread 10 USD, risk-% sizing): 129 trades, PF 2.22, net +29R, max drawdown 2.0R. 2025 worse half-year PF 2.05; 2026 PF 2.80 (34 trades).
; Harsh stress (1 min late, pessimistic trailing, 3 USD slippage, 2 USD commission): PF 1.64; 2025 worse half 1.54; 2026 PF 1.98.
; Chosen with ALL the data: no unseen test. Across the whole BTC search a good 2025 did not predict 2026 (median 2026 PF about 1.0).
; UNPROVEN: Strategy Tester (real ticks) and demo only. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD. MaxSpread_Points=3000 allows a 30 USD spread.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7h). The weekend close is off: BTC trades through the weekend at most brokers.
